        "original_id": "b28aa241-dd28-5d9c-88c0-f6b1fccf1ee0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cartoon Network Too, Nick Jr. Too, Teletoon\n- Products: Skatoony\n- Topics: overnight scheduling, reruns, channel launches\n\nFacts:\n- Cartoon Network Too and Nick Jr. Too both launched on 24 April 2006, and Nick Jr. Too was described as a rival channel to Cartoon Network Too.\n- During overnight hours, usually between midnight and 06:00, Cartoon Network Too aired some shows that were no longer being produced and were no longer in high demand, including Skatoony.\n- Skatoony reruns are still occasionally shown on Teletoon in Canada.",
